ho you wanna be, there are 1000s of cosmetics to unlock\n{1437460743988429}\n# Tables exist in the central Poker VR world", "short_description": "Pure, simple poker and blackjack in completely dynamic casino. Poker VR features multi table tournaments and cash games. It's the most intuitive and real life like poker and blackjack experience in VR! Host your own table, customize everything from looks to its identity. Play solo or take part in team events where every weekend 4 teams compete against each other for a different objective. "}]}, "developer_name": "Mega Particle, Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.poker-vr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.poker-vr.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Mega Particle, Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://www.discord.gg/pokervr", "website_url": "https://www.poker-vr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "1676485315806614"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "SOCIAL", "RELAXATION_MEDITATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "26274730952146431"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821099_764195749841896_7364044045958480970_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PeScIF5hqAoQ7kNvwFIX67T&_nc_oc=Adq2uwkTnq8rcvp6Ibeok8oPdIfvFYUSoEL9ZbzxJLDWKac5W_